use only the fixed layout; no normal book arm receives a coherent complete
continuation. The 656/713 later QA positions reaching F1 0.95 use supplied history
and do not replace autonomous answer scores. Both the original pilot and the
four-QA-erasure audit reject the final model. The full deployment retains
7.578 billion parameters; one-GPU execution does not establish a matched-quality
efficiency advantage. All results use reused development data and one model
reviewer, with no independent human adjudication. The subsequent joint writer
